# Raw source material for the site's scroll-scrubbed sections — each is a
# disposable intermediate (a full-size PNG sequence, or a single source
# video) that gets converted to a much smaller WebP sequence under
# web/public/ by a one-off script (see web/scripts/convert-*-frames.mjs);
# that converted output is what the site actually serves and is what's
# committed, not these.
